  "agent_track": {
    "id": "c0d8b4e3dd3b42c095d63d7dfa66431f",
    "title": "TPCTF 2026 · Agent Track",
    "title_i18n": {
      "zh-CN": "TPCTF 2026 · 智能体团队赛道",
      "en": "TPCTF 2026 · Agent Track"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh-CN": "首届 CCF 网络安全智能挑战赛暨“京华杯”TPCTF 2026，由中国计算机学会（CCF）主办、网络与系统安全专委会组织实施，清华大学（网络科学与网络空间研究院）与北京大学（计算中心）联合承办。大赛以“人机同台竞技”为核心理念，设**智能体赛道**（团队赛道，团队构建AI Agent 独立参赛）与**人机协同赛道**（团队赛道，每队不超过 4 人，选手与 AI 协同参赛），命题覆盖 Crypto、Reverse、Misc、Web、Pwn 与 AI 安全。",
      "en": "The 1st CCF Cybersecurity Intelligence Challenge — the “Jinghua Cup” TPCTF 2026 — is hosted by the China Computer Federation (CCF), organised by its Technical Committee on Network and System Security, and co-organised by Tsinghua University (Institute for Network Sciences and Cyberspace) and Peking University (Computer Center). Built around humans and AI competing side by side, it runs an **AI Agent Track** (autonomous agents) and a **Human-AI Collaboration Track** (players working with AI), in a 48-hour non-stop final covering Crypto, Reverse, Misc, Web, Pwn and AI security."
    },
