  "jinghua_thu": {
    "id": "cc6c7bfaee21477296b01d1ff8cf8fdc",
    "title": "Jinghua Cup 2026 · Tsinghua",
    "title_i18n": {
      "zh-CN": "TPCTF 2026 · 京华杯·清华校内赛",
      "en": "Jinghua Cup 2026 · Tsinghua"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh-CN": "京华杯·清华大学面向清华大学在校学生，为个人赛。与 TPCTF 2026 人机协同团队赛道使用同一套题目，单独报名、单独排名，不可同时参加TPCTF 2026的人机协同团队赛道。北京大学另设京华杯·北大校内赛，两场独立排名。\n\n比赛时间：2026 年 11 月 15 日 10:00 至 11 月 28 日 20:00（北京时间），期间连续开放。\n\n报名须使用已验证的清华大学学生邮箱（@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn）。",
      "en": "Jinghua Cup · Tsinghua is an individual event open to students of Tsinghua University. It uses the same challenges as the TPCTF 2026 Human-AI Collaboration Team Track, with its own registration and ranking; entrants may also register for the TPCTF tracks. Peking University has its own event, Jinghua Cup · PKU, ranked separately.\n\nSchedule: 15 November 2026, 10:00 to 22 November 2026, 20:00 (UTC+8), open continuously.\n\nRegistration requires a verified student email address of Tsinghua University (@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn)."
    },
